          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) A water tank is placed on the roof of a building at a height ‘H’. To get water with more pressure on the ground floor, one has to"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.14,
            0.719,
            0.161
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) increase the height "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { ^ { \\circ } H ^ { \\prime } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " at which the tank is placed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.161,
            0.723,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) decrease the height ‘H’ at which the tank is placed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.182,
            0.744,
            0.22
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) replace the tank with another tank of the same height that can hold more water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.221,
            0.744,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) replace the tank with another tank of the same height that can hold less water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.261,
            0.649,
            0.354
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) Two vessels, A and B contain water up to the same level as shown in Fig. 6.22. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { P _ { A } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { P _ { \\mathrm { { } _ { B } } } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is the pressure at the bottom of the vessels. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { F _ { A } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { F _ { \\mathrm { { \\scriptsize ~ B } } } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is the force exerted by the water at the bottom of the vessels A and B."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
